## Case 14

### Source: `test/tmp_fs/code.frog`

```frog
"A\n\x42\0é" let p n do n print p @u8 print p 1 + @u8 print p 2 + @u8 print p 3 + @u8 print p 4 + @u8 print end
```

### Run

Command:

```text
py -m frog run test/tmp_fs/code.frog
```

Output:

```text
[PRINT] INT():6@test/tmp_fs/code.frog:1:1
[PRINT] INT():65@test/tmp_fs/code.frog:1:24
[PRINT] INT():10@test/tmp_fs/code.frog:1:40
[PRINT] INT():66@test/tmp_fs/code.frog:1:56
[PRINT] INT():0@test/tmp_fs/code.frog:1:72
[PRINT] INT():195@test/tmp_fs/code.frog:1:88
```

### Build

Command:

